{"step_index":270,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T15:30:57Z","thinking":"**Implementing Database Upgrades**\n\nI'm currently working on upgrading the database file, `src/db/database.ts`. I'm focusing on incorporating native SQLite columns to store data from the ValuTeachers fields. These new columns will include fields like `school`, `age`, `planning_period`, `room_number`, `years_in_frs`, `text_ok`, `frs_knowledge`, and `frs_interests`. The `text_ok` column has a default value of 1.\n\n\n**Adding Data and SMS Templates**\n\nI've added new columns for various ValuTeachers fields: `custom_questions`, `meeting_preferences`, `annual_salary`, `present_403b_contribution`, and `follow_up_at`. I've also implemented pre-seeded SMS templates: `tpl_frs_meeting`, `tpl_frs_planning`, and `tpl_frs_drop`. I've also added the demo lead data for `Joseph Adona` at `VOL` to the database.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import { Platform } from 'react-native';\n\nexport interface IDatabase {\n  execAsync(sql: string): Promise<void>;\n  getAllAsync<T>(sql: string, params?: any[]): Promise<T[]>;\n  getFirstAsync<T>(sql: string, params?: any[]): Promise<T | null>;\n  runAsync(sql: string, params?: any[]): Promise<any>;\n  withTransactionAsync(fn: () => Promise<void>): Promise<void>;\n}\n\n// In-Memory / LocalStorage Web Database Implementation for 100% Web Compatibility\nclass WebDatabase implements IDatabase {\n  private lists: any[] = [];\n  private leads: any[] = [];\n  private call_logs: any[] = [];\n  private cadence_rules: any[] = [];\n  private sms_templates: any[] = [];\n  private settings: { key: string; value: string }[] = [];\n\n  constructor() {\n    this.loadFromStorage();\n  }\n\n  private loadFromStorage() {\n    try {\n      if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.localStorage) {\n        const saved = localStorage.getItem('snap_dialer_valuteachers_data');\n        if (saved) {\n          const parsed = JSON.parse(saved);\n          this.lists = parsed.lists || [];\n          this.leads = parsed.leads || [];\n          this.call_logs = parsed.call_logs || [];\n          this.cadence_rules = parsed.cadence_rules || [];\n          this.sms_templates = parsed.sms_templates || [];\n          this.settings = parsed.settings || [];\n        }\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.warn('Web localStorage load failed:', e);\n    }\n  }\n\n  private saveToStorage() {\n    try {\n      if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.localStorage) {\n        localStorage.setItem(\n          'snap_dialer_valuteachers_data',\n          JSON.stringify({\n            lists: this.lists,\n            leads: this.leads,\n            call_logs: this.call_logs,\n            cadence_rules: this.cadence_rules,\n            sms_templates: this.sms_templates,\n            settings: this.settings,\n          })\n        );\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.warn('Web localStorage save failed:', e);\n    }\n  }\n\n  async execAsync(sql: string): Promise<void> {}\n\n  async withTransactionAsync(fn: () => Promise<void>): Promise<void> {\n    await fn();\n    this.saveToStorage();\n  }\n\n  async getAllAsync<T>(sql: string, params: any[] = []): Promise<T[]> {\n    const s = sql.toLowerCase();\n    if (s.includes('from settings')) {\n      return [...this.settings] as any;\n    }\n    if (s.includes('from lists')) {\n      return [...this.lists] as any;\n    }\n    if (s.includes('from leads')) {\n      if (s.includes('where list_id = ?')) {\n        const listId = params[0];\n        let filtered = this.leads.filter((l) => l.list_id === listId);\n        if (s.includes(\"in ('pending', 'no_answer', 'voicemail')\")) {\n          filtered = filtered.filter(\n            (l) => !l.last_disposition || ['pending', 'no_answer', 'voicemail'].includes(l.last_disposition)\n          );\n        }\n        return filtered as any;\n      }\n      if (s.includes('where follow_up_at is not null')) {\n        return this.leads.filter((l) => !!l.follow_up_at) as any;\n      }\n      return [...this.leads] as any;\n    }\n    if (s.includes('from call_logs')) {\n      if (s.includes('where lead_id = ?')) {\n        return this.call_logs.filter((c) => c.lead_id === params[0]) as any;\n      }\n      return [...this.call_logs] as any;\n    }\n    if (s.includes('from cadence_rules')) {\n      return [...this.cadence_rules] as any;\n    }\n    if (s.includes('from sms_templates')) {\n      return [...this.sms_templates] as any;\n    }\n    return [];\n  }\n\n  async getFirstAsync<T>(sql: string, params: any[] = []): Promise<T | null> {\n    const s = sql.toLowerCase();\n    if (s.includes('from sms_templates') && s.includes('count(*)')) {\n      return { count: this.sms_templates.length } as any;\n    }\n    if (s.includes('from sms_templates where id = ?')) {\n      const match = this.sms_templates.find((t) => t.id === params[0]);\n      return (match || null) as any;\n    }\n    if (s.includes('from cadence_rules where step_number = ?')) {\n      const match = this.cadence_rules.find((r) => r.step_number === params[0]);\n      return (match || null) as any;\n    }\n    if (s.includes('from leads where id = ?')) {\n      const match = this.leads.find((l) => l.id === params[0]);\n      return (match || null) as any;\n    }\n    if (s.includes('from lists where id = ?')) {\n      const match = this.lists.find((l) => l.id === params[0]);\n      return (match || null) as any;\n    }\n    if (s.includes('from settings where key = ?')) {\n      const match = this.settings.find((st) => st.key === params[0]);\n      return (match || null) as any;\n    }\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  async runAsync(sql: string, params: any[] = []): Promise<any> {\n    const s = sql.toLowerCase();\n    if (s.includes('insert into lists')) {\n      this.lists.push({\n        id: params[0],\n        title: params[1],\n        source_image_uri: params[2],\n        total_leads: params[3],\n        completed_leads: params[4] || 0,\n        connected_leads: params[5] || 0,\n        created_at: params[6] || new Date().toISOString(),\n        updated_at: params[7] || new Date().toISOString(),\n      });\n    } else if (s.includes('insert into leads')) {\n      this.leads.push({\n        id: params[0],\n        list_id: params[1],\n        name: params[2],\n        phone: params[3],\n        school: params[4] || 'VOL',\n        email: params[5] || null,\n        age: params[6] || null,\n        planning_period: params[7] || null,\n        room_number: params[8] || null,\n        years_in_frs: params[9] || null,\n        text_ok: params[10] !== undefined ? params[10] : 1,\n        frs_knowledge: params[11] || null,\n        frs_interests: typeof params[12] === 'string' ? JSON.parse(params[12] || '[]') : params[12] || [],\n        custom_questions: params[13] || null,\n        meeting_preferences: typeof params[14] === 'string' ? JSON.parse(params[14] || '[]') : params[14] || [],\n        annual_salary: params[15] || null,\n        present_403b_contribution: params[16] || null,\n        company: params[17] || 'ValuTeachers',\n        notes: params[18] || null,\n        cadence_step: params[19] || 1,\n        last_disposition: params[20] || 'pending',\n        attempts_count: params[21] || 0,\n        created_at: params[22] || new Date().toISOString(),\n        updated_at: params[23] || new Date().toISOString(),\n      });\n    } else if (s.includes('insert into call_logs')) {\n      this.call_logs.push({\n        id: params[0],\n        lead_id: params[1],\n        list_id: params[2],\n        timestamp: params[3],\n        duration_seconds: params[4],\n        disposition: params[5],\n        note: params[6],\n        sms_sent: params[7],\n        sms_body: params[8],\n      });\n    } else if (s.includes('insert into sms_templates')) {\n      const existingIdx = this.sms_templates.findIndex((t) => t.id === params[0]);\n      if (existingIdx >= 0) {\n        this.sms_templates[existingIdx] = { id: params[0], title: params[1], body: params[2] };\n      } else {\n        this.sms_templates.push({ id: params[0], title: params[1], body: params[2] });\n      }\n    } else if (s.includes('insert into cadence_rules')) {\n      this.cadence_rules.push({\n        id: params[0],\n        step_number: params[1],\n        condition_disposition: params[2],\n        action_type: params[3],\n        sms_template_id: params[4],\n        delay_hours: params[5],\n      });\n    } else if (s.includes('update leads set')) {\n      const leadId = params[params.length - 1];\n      const lead = this.leads.find((l) => l.id === leadId);\n      if (lead) {\n        if (s.includes('follow_up_at = ?')) {\n          lead.follow_up_at = params[0];\n          lead.last_disposition = 'callback_requested';\n          if (params[1]) lead.notes = params[1];\n        } else {\n          lead.last_disposition = params[0];\n          lead.attempts_count = params[1];\n          lead.cadence_step = params[2];\n          lead.last_attempt_at = params[3];\n          if (params[4]) lead.notes = params[4];\n          lead.updated_at = params[5];\n        }\n      }\n    } else if (s.includes('update lists set')) {\n      const listId = params[params.length - 1];\n      const list = this.lists.find((l) => l.id === listId);\n      if (list) {\n        list.completed_leads = params[0];\n        list.connected_leads = params[1];\n        list.updated_at = params[2];\n      }\n    } else if (s.includes('insert into settings')) {\n      const existingIdx = this.settings.findIndex((st) => st.key === params[0]);\n      if (existingIdx >= 0) {\n        this.settings[existingIdx] = { key: params[0], value: params[1] };\n      } else {\n        this.settings.push({ key: params[0], value: params[1] });\n      }\n    } else if (s.includes('delete from lists where id = ?')) {\n      const listId = params[0];\n      this.lists = this.lists.filter((l) => l.id !== listId);\n      this.leads = this.leads.filter((l) => l.list_id !== listId);\n      this.call_logs = this.call_logs.filter((c) => c.list_id !== listId);\n    }\n    this.saveToStorage();\n    return { changes: 1 };\n  }\n}\n\nlet dbInstance: IDatabase | null = null;\n\nexport async function getDatabase(): Promise<IDatabase> {\n  if (dbInstance) {\n    return dbInstance;\n  }\n\n  if (Platform.OS === 'web') {\n    const webDb = new WebDatabase();\n    await initWebDefaults(webDb);\n    dbInstance = webDb;\n    return dbInstance;\n  }\n\n  // Native iOS and Android\n  const SQLite = await import('expo-sqlite');\n  const nativeDb = await SQLite.openDatabaseAsync('snap_dialer_valuteachers.db');\n  await initNativeDatabase(nativeDb);\n  dbInstance = nativeDb as unknown as IDatabase;\n  return dbInstance;\n}\n\nasync function initWebDefaults(db: WebDatabase) {\n  const templates = await db.getAllAsync('SELECT * FROM sms_templates');\n  if (templates.length === 0) {\n    await db.runAsync('INSERT INTO sms_templates', [\n      'tpl_frs_meeting',\n      'ValuTeachers Meeting Confirmation',\n      'Hi {{name}}, this is {{my_name}} with ValuTeachers. I received your FRS Report Card from {{school}}. I see you requested to connect on {{meeting_pref}} to review your Florida State Retirement & 403(b) options. Does that time still work for you?',\n    ]);\n    await db.runAsync('INSERT INTO sms_templates', [\n      'tpl_frs_planning',\n      'Planning Period Follow-up',\n      'Hi {{name}}, {{my_name}} with ValuTeachers here! Tried catching you regarding your FRS retirement analysis. Would reaching you during your planning period work better for a quick 5-min chat?',\n    ]);\n    await db.runAsync('INSERT INTO sms_templates', [\n      'tpl_frs_drop',\n      'D.R.O.P. & Pension Review',\n      'Hi {{name}}, regarding your {{years_in_frs}} years in the Florida Retirement System and your FRS analysis request, what day this week is best to review your numbers?',\n    ]);\n\n    await db.runAsync('INSERT INTO cadence_rules', ['cad_1', 1, 'no_answer', 'call_only', null, 2]);\n    await db.runAsync('INSERT INTO cadence_rules', ['cad_2', 2, 'no_answer', 'call_and_sms', 'tpl_frs_meeting', 24]);\n    await db.runAsync('INSERT INTO cadence_rules', ['cad_3', 3, 'no_answer', 'call_and_sms', 'tpl_frs_planning', 48]);\n\n    // Seed Joseph Adona demo list\n    const sampleLeads = [\n      {\n        id: 'lead_joseph_adona',\n        list_id: 'list_volusia_sample',\n        name: 'Joseph Adona',\n        phone: '(386) 212-3234',\n        email: 'jradona@volusia.k12.fl.us',\n        school: 'VOL (Volusia County)',\n        age: '42',\n        planning_period: '',\n        room_number: '',\n        years_in_frs: '9',\n        text_ok: 1,\n        frs_knowledge: 'I know a little',\n        frs_interests: JSON.stringify([\n          'Florida State Retirement and/or 403b Plans',\n          'Guaranteed interest & 5% bonus on contributions/rollovers',\n          'Saving for retirement but need clarity on plans',\n        ]),\n        custom_questions: '',\n        meeting_preferences: JSON.stringify([\n          '1. Mon 1-2 PM',\n          '2. Wed 1-2 PM',\n          '3. Fri 1-2 PM',\n        ]),\n        company: 'ValuTeachers',\n        notes: 'Requested FRS report card review. High interest in 5% bonus.',\n      },\n    ];\n\n    await db.runAsync(\n      'INSERT INTO lists (id, title, source_image_uri, total_leads, completed_leads, connected_leads, created_at, updated_at)',\n      ['list_volusia_sample', 'ValuTeachers - Volusia School Roster', null, 1, 0, 0, new Date().toISOString(), new Date().toISOString()]\n    );\n\n    for (const lead of sampleLeads) {\n      await db.runAsync(\n        `INSERT INTO leads (id, list_id, name, phone, school, email, age, planning_period, room_number, years_in_frs, text_ok, frs_knowledge, frs_interests, custom_questions, meeting_preferences, annual_salary, present_403b_contribution, company, notes, cadence_step, last_disposition, attempts_count, created_at, updated_at)\n         VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, 1, 'pending', 0, ?, ?)`,\n        [\n          lead.id,\n          lead.list_id,\n          lead.name,\n          lead.phone,\n          lead.school,\n          lead.email,\n          lead.age,\n          lead.planning_period,\n          lead.room_number,\n          lead.years_in_frs,\n          lead.text_ok,\n          lead.frs_knowledge,\n          lead.frs_interests,\n          lead.custom_questions,\n          lead.meeting_preferences,\n          null,\n          null,\n          lead.company,\n          lead.notes,\n          new Date().toISOString(),\n          new Date().toISOString(),\n        ]\n      );\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nasync function initNativeDatabase(db: any): Promise<void> {\n  await db.execAsync(`\n    PRAGMA journal_mode = WAL;\n    PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON;\n\n    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS lists (\n      id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n      title TEXT NOT NULL,\n      source_image_uri TEXT,\n      total_leads INTEGER DEFAULT 0,\n      completed_leads INTEGER DEFAULT 0,\n      connected_leads INTEGER DEFAULT 0,\n      created_at TEXT NOT NULL,\n      updated_at TEXT NOT NULL\n    );\n\n    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS leads (\n      id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n      list_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n      name TEXT NOT NULL,\n      phone TEXT NOT NULL,\n      school TEXT,\n      email TEXT,\n      age TEXT,\n      planning_period TEXT,\n      room_number TEXT,\n      years_in_frs TEXT,\n      text_ok INTEGER DEFAULT 1,\n      frs_knowledge TEXT,\n      frs_interests TEXT,\n      custom_questions TEXT,\n      meeting_preferences TEXT,\n      annual_salary TEXT,\n      present_403b_contribution TEXT,\n      company TEXT,\n      notes TEXT,\n      cadence_step INTEGER DEFAULT 1,\n      last_attempt_at TEXT,\n      last_disposition TEXT DEFAULT 'pending',\n      follow_up_at TEXT,\n      attempts_count INTEGER DEFAULT 0,\n      created_at TEXT NOT NULL,\n      updated_at TEXT NOT NULL,\n      FOREIGN KEY (list_id) REFERENCES lists(id) ON DELETE CASCADE\n    );\n\n    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS call_logs (\n      id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n      lead_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n      list_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n      timestamp TEXT NOT NULL,\n      duration_seconds INTEGER DEFAULT 0,\n      disposition TEXT NOT NULL,\n      note TEXT,\n      sms_sent INTEGER DEFAULT 0,\n      sms_body TEXT,\n      FOREIGN KEY (lead_id) REFERENCES leads(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n      FOREIGN KEY (list_id) REFERENCES lists(id) ON DELETE CASCADE\n    );\n\n    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS cadence_rules (\n      id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n      step_number INTEGER NOT NULL,\n      condition_disposition TEXT NOT NULL,\n      action_type TEXT NOT NULL,\n      sms_template_id TEXT,\n      delay_hours INTEGER DEFAULT 24\n    );\n\n    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS sms_templates (\n      id TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n      title TEXT NOT NULL,\n      body TEXT NOT NULL\n    );\n\n    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS settings (\n      key TEXT PRIMARY KEY NOT NULL,\n      value TEXT NOT NULL\n    );\n\n    CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_leads_list_id ON leads(list_id);\n    CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_leads_status ON leads(last_disposition);\n    CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_call_logs_lead ON call_logs(lead_id);\n  `);\n\n  const templateCount = await db.getFirstAsync('SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM sms_templates');\n  if (!templateCount || templateCount.count === 0) {\n    await db.runAsync(\n      `INSERT INTO sms_templates (id, title, body) VALUES \n       ('tpl_frs_meeting', 'ValuTeachers Meeting Confirmation', 'Hi {{name}}, this is {{my_name}} with ValuTeachers. I received your FRS Report Card from {{school}}. I see you requested to connect on {{meeting_pref}} to review your Florida State Retirement & 403(b) options. Does that time still work for you?'),\n       ('tpl_frs_planning', 'Planning Period Follow-up', 'Hi {{name}}, {{my_name}} with ValuTeachers here! Tried catching you regarding your FRS retirement analysis. Would reaching you during your planning period work better for a quick 5-min chat?'),\n       ('tpl_frs_drop', 'D.R.O.P. & Pension Review', 'Hi {{name}}, regarding your {{years_in_frs}} years in the Florida Retirement System and your FRS analysis request, what day this week is best to review your numbers?')`\n    );\n\n    await db.runAsync(\n      `INSERT INTO cadence_rules (id, step_number, condition_disposition, action_type, sms_template_id, delay_hours) VALUES\n       ('cad_1', 1, 'no_answer', 'call_only', NULL, 2),\n       ('cad_2', 2, 'no_answer', 'call_and_sms', 'tpl_frs_meeting', 24),\n       ('cad_3', 3, 'no_answer', 'call_and_sms', 'tpl_frs_planning', 48)`\n    );\n  }\n}\n","Description":"Upgraded database.ts with ValuTeachers schema, FRS templates, and Joseph Adona sample data","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer\\src\\db\\database.ts","toolAction":"Updating database.ts for ValuTeachers","toolSummary":"Update database.ts with ValuTeachers schema"}}]}
